        "text_UyHGBT": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>Free Spirited Reviews: See What Our Happy Customers Are Saying!</strong></p><p>Looking for <strong>honest Free Spirited reviews</strong> before placing your order? You're in the right place! We take pride in our <strong>handcrafted tie-dye shirts</strong>, and our customers love them too! Check out real customer feedback below.</p><p>⭐ <strong>Why Customers Love Free Spirited</strong></p><p>✅ <strong>Super Soft & Comfortable:</strong> \"This is the softest shirt I’ve ever owned! It feels amazing, even after washing.\" – ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ Sarah T.</p><p>✅ <strong>Vibrant Colors That Last:</strong> \"The colors are stunning and stay bright wash after wash.\" – ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ Lisa M.</p><p>✅ <strong>True-to-Size Fit:</strong> \"Finally, a tie-dye brand that carries plus sizes that actually fit well!\" – ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ Mary J.</p><p>✅ <strong>Fast & Reliable Shipping:</strong> \"I got my order quickly, and the customer service was top-notch!\" – ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ Carol W.</p><p>✅ <strong>One-of-a-Kind Designs:</strong> \"Each shirt is unique, and I love knowing no one else has the exact same one!\" – ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ Debbie P.</p><p><strong>Is Free Spirited Legit?</strong></p><p>Yes! <strong>Free Spirited is a trusted, customer-loved brand</strong> with thousands of happy buyers. We focus on <strong>quality, comfort, and exceptional service.</strong></p><p>✔️ <strong>Thousands of satisfied customers</strong><br/>✔️ <strong>100% pre-shrunk cotton for the perfect fit</strong><br/>✔️ <strong>Hassle-free returns & exchanges</strong><br/>✔️ <strong>Secure checkout & fast shipping</strong></p><p><strong>Still unsure? Read more Free Spirited reviews below!</strong></p><p><strong>Verified Free Spirited Reviews</strong></p><p>We’re proud to have earned <strong>hundreds of 5-star reviews</strong> from customers who love our products. Here’s what people are saying:</p><p>🛍️ <a href=\"https://shopfreespirited.com/pages/reviews\"><strong>See More Free Spirited Reviews Here</strong></a></p><p><strong>How to Leave a Review for Free Spirited</strong></p><p>Love your new tie-dye? We'd love to hear from you! Share your experience by:</p><p>1️⃣ <strong>Leaving a review on our website</strong> after your purchase<br/>2️⃣ <strong>Tagging us on Instagram</strong> <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/shop_freespirited/\">@shop_freespirited</a> with your Free Spirited gear<br/></p><p><strong>Join Thousands of Happy Free Spirited Customers Today!</strong></p><p>💜 <strong>Ready to shop?</strong> Browse our best-selling tie-dye shirts now!</p><p>🛒 <a href=\"https://shopfreespirited.com/collections/shop-sale\"><strong>Shop Free Spirited Now</strong></a></p>"
